{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29165","headline":"郊居春日有怀府中诸公幷柬王兵曹 · 许浑","name":"郊居春日有怀府中诸公幷柬王兵曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲学渔翁钓艇新，濯缨犹惜九衢尘。\n花前更谢依刘客，雪後空怀访戴人。\n僧舍覆碁消白日，市楼赊酒过青春。\n一山桃杏同时发，谁似东风不厌贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}